# Cassettes ship ONLY as .json.zst packages (degenbot_rpc::cassette owns the
# artifact codec); a plain .json here is an unpackaged recording, regenerable
# output that the reader prefers while it exists.
*.json
# The one .json artifact that is committed source, not regenerable output: the
# recorder replay seed (degenbot.aave-seed/v1), the substrate rows a cassette
# replay restores. The offline seed gate re-exports it byte-for-byte.
!*.seed.json
